  "description": "The META V5 ESSENTIAL is a build with robust components that ensure consistent performance.\n• The FOX 36 Float Performance fork with three-position Grip cartridge sits at the front of the bike. At the rear, the FOX Float X that better controls impacts thanks to an enlarged piston.\n• The SHIMANO SLX 4-piston brakes are constant and sharp.\n• DT SWISS take care of the wheels with E 532 tubeless rims specifically for enduro. Combined with Formula hubs and Sapim spokes they are particularly robust.\n• A SHIMANO SLX 12-speed drivetrain is perfect for climbing.",
